  "description": "5-year-old Eiry Ortezo may look adorable, but she’s a taekwondo prodigy with flawless manners and a heart full of courage. Her peaceful life is turned upside down when a mysterious voice declares her the savior of the North, a land consumed by demonic energy. Determined to fulfill her destiny, Eiry journeys to meet the father she’s never known and thaw the heart he sealed away long ago. Can this little lady bring warmth back to the frozen North, or will darkness inevitably swallow it whole?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
